  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "If \\[ f\\left(\\frac{x}{x-1}\\right)=\\frac1x \\] for all \\(x\\notin\\{0,1\\},\\) and \\(0\\lt\\theta\\lt\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\) then \\(f(\\sec^2\\theta)=\\)",
